# Manual override from the operator UI.
#
#   enable=true   -> force the supervisor into a recovery attempt right now,
#                    skipping the SUSPECT timer (the PROBE clearance check still
#                    applies -- an operator cannot force the robot into a gap it
#                    does not fit through).
#   enable=false  -> abort any running recovery and clear a latched ABORT/BLOCKED.
bool enable
string reason
---
bool success
string message
